486: ```tsx
487: import type { BoardListData, BoardCardData } from "@repo/plugin-web-board-core";
488: import type { Lang } from "./internal/i18n.js";
489: 
490: export interface MapViewProps {
491:   lists: readonly BoardListData[];
492:   lang: Lang;
493:   /** Optional callback when a pin is clicked. Receives (cardId, listId). */
494:   onSelectCard?: (cardId: string, listId: string) => void;
495: }
496: 
497: export const MapView: React.LazyExoticComponent<React.ComponentType<MapViewProps>>;
498: ```
499: 
500: **Behavior**
501: 
502: - Lazy-loaded via `React.lazy(() => import("./MapView.js"))` at the index.ts
503:   re-export seam (Suspense boundary lives in the consumer — `BoardModule` and
504:   `BoardWorkspacesModule`).
505: - On mount: dynamically imports `leaflet` + `leaflet/dist/leaflet.css`,
506:   initialises `L.map(containerRef.current)`, sets tile layer
507:   `L.tileLayer('https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', { attribution: '© OpenStreetMap contributors', maxZoom: 19 })`.
508: - Filters `lists.flatMap(l => l.cards.map(c => ({ card: c, listId: l.id })))`
509:   through `isValidLocation(card.location)`.
510: - Renders one `L.marker([loc.lat, loc.lng])` per valid card; binds a popup
511:   with `card.title[lang]` + `loc.label`.
512: - On marker click: calls `onSelectCard?.(card.id, listId)`.
513: - `fitBounds` to all pins (with 50px padding) if ≥1; else `setView([0,0], 2)` (world view) + empty-state overlay copy.
514: - Cleanup: `useEffect` return calls `map.remove()` to dispose Leaflet instance + listeners.
522: |---|---|
523: | `leaflet` dynamic import fails (network / CSP block) | Lazy `<Suspense>` catches; ErrorBoundary fallback shows bilingual "Map failed to load." text; no crash |
524: | `lists` empty OR no card has valid `location` | Empty-state overlay (per §S15.4); blank map tile background still renders |
525: | `card.location` is malformed (NaN / out-of-range) | Filtered out by `isValidLocation`; no error; card silently omitted from Map |
526: | `card.location.lng === 180` / `lat === -90` (edge of valid range) | Accepted (inclusive bounds); marker placed at the edge |
527: | Tile fetch fails (network) | Leaflet's internal retry; grey tile placeholder visible; no crash |
528: | CSP blocks tile origin | Browser console error visible; tiles fail to render but map UI is intact |
